seriousness, incorruptibility,"},{"verse":8,"text":"and soundness of speech that can’t be condemned, that he who opposes you may be ashamed, having no evil thing to say about us."},{"verse":9,"text":"Exhort servants to be in subjection to their own masters and to be well-pleasing in all things, not contradicting,"},{"verse":10,"text":"not stealing, but showing all good fidelity, that they may adorn the doctrine of God, our Savior, in all things."},{"verse":11,"text":"For the grace of God has appeared, bringing salvation to all men,"},{"verse":12,"text":"instructing us to the intent that, denying ungodliness and worldly lusts, we would live soberly, righteously, and godly in this present age;"},{"verse":13,"text":"looking for the blessed hope and appearing of the glory of our great God and Savior, Jesus Christ,"},{"verse":14,"text":"who gave himself for us, that he might redeem us from all iniquity and purify for himself a people for his own possession, zealous for good works."},{"verse":15,"text":"Say these things and exhort and reprove with all authority. Let no one despise you."}],"hasArtwork":true,"artworkUrl":"/data/images/books/titus.svg","availableLangs":["en","zh-CN"]},{"id":"titus_3","bookSlug":"titus","chapter":3,"reference":"Titus 3","title":"Titus 3 — Public Domain Study","topics":["titus","titus","nt","scripture","提多書","提多书","熱心行善","热心行善"],"snippet":{"en":"Remind them to be in subjection to rulers and to authorities, to be obedient, to be ready for every good work,","zh-CN":"你要提醒众人，叫他们顺服作官的、掌权的，遵他的命，预备行各样的善事。"},"tokens":{"15":2,"56":1,"titus":10,"public":2,"domain":2,"study":1,"nt":1,"scripture":1,"提多書":1,"提多书":2,"熱心行善":1,"热心行善":1,"remind":2,"them":3,"to":27,"be":15,"in":6,"subjection":2,"rulers":2,"and":15,"authorities":2,"obedient":2,"ready":2,"for":6,"every":2,"good":5,"work":2,"speak":1,"evil":1,"of":9,"no":1,"one":3,"not":3,"contentious":1,"gentle":1,"showing":1,"all":6,"humility":1,"toward":2,"men":2,"we":3,"were":1,"also":2,"once":1,"foolish":2,"d